  "visualDNA": {
    "Overview": "Development of the architecture by techniques already used in Roman architecture and of the Mediterranean countries. On these lines, the Kingdom of Valencia was influenced by arriving from France. Clear predominance of the architecture of the cultures of the Mediterranean countries respect of the influence of the French Gothic. The architectural proportions do not change with the arrival of the Renaissance. Clear influence of Flamboyant Gothic, which confers uniqueness."
  },
